<title>USA: Meris hires Price Waterhouse unit.</title>
<headline>Meris hires Price Waterhouse unit.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meris Laboratories Inc said it entered an agreement with BTS LLC, a unit of Price Waterhouse LLP, to provide Meris assistance in achieving a corporate turnaround or business combination.</p>
<p>Meris also said it appointed Dennis Simon as its president and chief executive officer and Phil Tremonti as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
